# KupaPay monorepo — environment variable index (no secrets here).
#
# Copy the app-specific example that matches what you are running:
#   Mobile (Expo):  cost-share-app/apps/mobile/.env.example  → apps/mobile/.env
#   Web (Next):     cost-share-app/apps/web/.env.example     → apps/web/.env.local
#   Supabase CLI:   cost-share-app/supabase/.env.example     → supabase/.env
#
# Never commit real keys. See docs/TEAM_ONBOARDING.md and docs/SSOT/SUPABASE_ENVIRONMENTS.md.
